WEBVTT

00:00:00.111 --> 00:00:05.439
This video shows how to create a transport route and add its stops on a phone.

00:00:07.101 --> 00:00:13.893
Tap the menu button, open Transport and choose Routes. Tap Add Route at the top right.

00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:38.864
Enter the route name, Gulberg Route, where it starts, School Gate, and where it ends, Gulberg III. Scroll down and enter the estimated duration, 35 minutes.

00:00:56.654 --> 00:01:03.494
Tap Create Route. The new route appears in the list as a card showing where it starts and ends.

00:01:16.836 --> 00:01:21.612
Tap the route name to open its stops, then tap + Add Stop.

00:01:29.434 --> 00:01:38.650
Name the stop Gulberg Market. Scroll down and set the pickup time to 7:45 AM and the drop time to 2:15 PM.

00:01:53.967 --> 00:01:59.607
Tap Add Stop. The stop shows in the route with its order and times.

00:02:12.447 --> 00:02:17.775
The route and its first stop are ready, and students can now be assigned to it.
